WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.420
In 2024, the main donor
governments gave 212.1 billion

2
00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:07.320
dollars in official aid.

3
00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.650
Yet only 4 of them went above the United

4
00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:13.750
Nations target of 0.7 per
cent of national income.

5
00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:18.380
And economists still disagree about
what all that aid does for growth.

6
00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:22.280
So when rich countries give
or lend to poorer ones,

7
00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:24.880
when does it actually help them grow?

8
00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:28.080
In this mission, you'll
sort aid into its types,

9
00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:29.670
and see what it can do to a poor

10
00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:32.010
economy's demand and supply.

11
00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:34.410
Then you'll find out why a debt in dollars

12
00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:36.620
can grow with no new borrowing,

13
00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:39.210
and who steps in when it cannot pay.

14
00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:42.350
Your mission: find out
when aid really pays off

15
00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:43.960
for the country that receives it.
